1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
I started painting last month, and I love it.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:04,950
That's awesome! What kind of things do you paint?

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,700
Mostly landscapes, but I want to try portraits soon.

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:13,130
Portraits sound tricky. Do you use watercolors or oils?

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:17,120
I use watercolors for now. They are easier to clean up.

6
00:00:17,469 --> 00:00:21,149
Nice. Maybe you can show me one of your paintings sometime.
